        "bytes": 419,
        "text": "// Notes-as-code. Some block comments + dead snippets I want to keep\n// near the rest of the project, not in a separate notes app.\n\n// Idea: a tiny actor model. Mailbox per actor, single-threaded scheduler.\n// fn spawn(behaviour: fn(Mailbox)) -> ActorId { ... }\n// fn send(to: ActorId, msg: Any)            { ... }\n\n// Idea: maybe wrap fs.read in something that retries on EINTR.\n// Probably overkill for this project.\n"
